diff --git a/golang/uPIMulator/benchmark/GENERIC/README.md b/golang/uPIMulator/benchmark/GENERIC/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..d936b0f8ee5091d3b2b1ad6adcc54c0edddb56f4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/golang/uPIMulator/benchmark/GENERIC/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
+# GENERIC benchmark adapter
+
+`GENERIC` runs an externally generated DPU program with raw binary fixtures.
+Stage the program as `dpu/task.c`; optional support `.c` files may be placed in
+the same directory and remain separate translation units. Headers may be
+placed in `dpu/` or `GENERIC/`.
+
+Pass `--benchmark GENERIC --fixture_dir /path/to/fixture`. The fixture directory
+must contain a version-1 `manifest.json`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "schema_version": 1,
+  "num_dpus": 1,
+  "num_tasklets": 12,
+  "executions": [
+    {
+      "dpus": [
+        {
+          "host_inputs": {"DPU_INPUT_ARGUMENTS": "arguments.bin"},
+          "host_outputs": {"result": "expected-result.bin"},
+          "mram_heap_input": {"offset": 0, "file": "heap-input.bin"},
+          "mram_heap_output": {"offset": 4096, "file": "expected-output.bin"}
+        }
+      ]
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+Each host map key is the exact `__host` symbol name and each value is a raw
+binary file path relative to the fixture directory. MRAM heap entries are
+optional; omitted entries become zero-length fixtures at offset zero. Multiple
+executions and DPUs are represented by adding array entries. Manifest DPU and
+tasklet counts must exactly match the simulator command line.
+
+Paths are deliberately relative and may not escape `fixture_dir`, keeping a
+fixture bundle relocatable. Host names must be C identifiers and may not begin
+with `dpu_mram_heap_pointer_name`, which is reserved by uPIMulator's fixture
+filename parser. `GENERIC` verifies only regions listed under `host_outputs`
+and `mram_heap_output`; omitted output regions are not correctness-checked.
diff --git a/golang/uPIMulator/benchmark/GENERIC/dpu/CMakeLists.txt b/golang/uPIMulator/benchmark/GENERIC/dpu/CMakeLists.txt
